{"ref":"BDB, הֶ֫בֶל²","hw":"הֶ֫בֶל²","html":"† II. <big><big><span dir=\"rtl\">הֶ֫בֶל</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">הָ֑בֶל</span></big></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. (</strong>perhaps i.q. Assyrian <em>ablu</em>, son, COT<sup>Gloss.</sup> cf. also We<sup>Skizzen iii. 70</sup>: der. from <a data-ref=\"BDB, הֶ֫בֶל\" href=\"/BDB,_הֶ֫בֶל\", dir=\"rtl\">I. הֶבֶל</a> not prob.<strong>)</strong> second son of Adam <a data-ref=\"Genesis 4:2\" href=\"/Genesis.4.2\">Gn 4:2</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 4:4\" href=\"/Genesis.4.4\">4</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 4:8\" href=\"/Genesis.4.8\">8</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 4:9\" href=\"/Genesis.4.9\">9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 4:25\" href=\"/Genesis.4.25\">25</a>.","next":"BDB, הָבְנִי","prev":"BDB, הָבַל"}